? <?>
....main....
1. <Γ>; x: A; <Δ[x]> ⊢ g[x] ∈ B<|Γ|>[]
2. <Γ>; x: A; <Δ[x]> ⊢ f<|Γ|>[g[x]] ≡ x
3. <Γ>; y: B; <Δ[f[y]]> ⊢ C[f<|Γ|>[y]]
====
<Γ>; x: A; <Δ[x]> ⊢ C[x]

BY assumT 2 thenT letAtT 2 <<'y='g['x] in 'B>> ttca

1. [?]
   ....main....
   <Γ>; x2: B; x: A; <Δ[x]>; f<|Γ|>[x2] ≡ x ⊢ C[x]
