3. <Γ>; x: a < b; <Δ[x]>; b<|Γ|>[]≥(a<|Γ|>[] + 1) ⊢ C[x]
====
<Γ>; x: a < b; <Δ[x]> ⊢ C[x]

BY backThruAssumT 3 twa

