== itt_omega ge_mulMonoPosit_rw
? <?>
....main....
1. <Γ> ⊢ c > 0
2. <Γ> ⊢ a ∈ int
3. <Γ> ⊢ b ∈ int
4. <Γ> ⊢ c ∈ int
====
<Γ> ⊢ a≥b ≡ (c * a)≥(c * b)

