== itt_w tree_indEquality
? <?>
........
1. <Γ> ⊢ z1 = z2 ∈ (Wx:A.B[x])
2.
   1. <Γ>
   2. a: A
   3. f: B[a] ─→ (Wx:A.B[x])
   4. g: b:B[a] ─→ T[f b]
   ⊢ body1[a; f; g] = body2[a; f; g] ∈ T[tree(a, f)]
====

1. <Γ>
⊢ (tree_ind(g. let tree(a, f) = z1 in body1[a; f; g])
  = (tree_ind(g2. let tree(a2, f2) = z2 in body2[a2; f2; g2]) ∈ T[z1]

BY assertEqT <<'z1='z2 in w{'A;x.'B['x]}>> taa

1. [?]
   ....main....

   1. <Γ>
   2. z: Wx:A.B[x]
   ⊢ (tree_ind(g. let tree(a, f) = z in body1[a; f; g])
     = (tree_ind(g2. let tree(a2, f2) = z in body2[a2; f2; g2]) ∈ T[z]
