== itt_list_set mem_append_left
? <?>
....main....
1. <Γ> ⊢ x ∈ ty
2. <Γ> ⊢ l1 ∈ ty List
3. <Γ> ⊢ l2 ∈ ty List
4. <Γ> ⊢ mem(x ∈ l1 in ty List)
====
<Γ> ⊢ mem(x ∈ l1○ l2 in ty List)

BY genAssumT [2; 4] thenT dT (-1) ttca

1. [?]
   ....main....

   1. <Γ>
   2. u: ty
   3. v1: ty List
   4. mem(x ∈ v1 in ty List) ═⇒ mem(x ∈ v1○ l2 in ty List)
   ⊢ mem(x ∈ u::v1 in ty List) ═⇒ mem(x ∈ u::v1○ l2 in ty List)
