== itt_record_renaming rename_rcrd_reduce
? <?>
....main....

1. <Γ>
⊢ {r; c = x}[a/b] ≡
  (if b = c then
      {r[a/b]; a = x}
   else
      (if a = c then {r[a/b]; b = x} else {r[a/b]; c = x}))

BY decideEqLabelT <<label[b:t]>> <<label[c:t]>>

1. [?]
   ....main....
   <Γ>; b = c ∈ Label ⊢ {r; c = x}[a/b] ≡ {r[a/b]; a = x}
2. [?]
   ........

   1. <Γ>
   2. b ≠ c ∈ Label
   ⊢ {r; c = x}[a/b] ≡ (if a = c then {r[a/b]; b = x} else {r[a/b]; c = x})
